#!ipxe
# Local-asset override. Copy this file to local-vars.ipxe (next to menu.ipxe,
# in the TFTP root /config/menus) and point the local asset origin at your
# nginx server. menu.ipxe chains local-vars.ipxe before boot.cfg, so this wins
# over boot.cfg's default. release_menu.sh excludes local-vars.ipxe from
# menus.tar.gz, so a lab IP never leaks into a shipped release.
#
# nginx serves the container /assets tree at its root; direct_file assets are
# imported on-demand by the Assets tab into /assets/<os>-<version>-<arch>/ and
# served at <local_endpoint><key>/, so local_endpoint carries a trailing slash.
# This only affects direct_file entries — iso_extraction still chains
# ${mirror_endpoint}${asset_path} (the GitHub origin set in boot.cfg).
set local_endpoint http://192.168.7.1:8080/
